     """Fused MoE forward using the RDNA3 W4A16 HIP kernel.
 
+    ``gemm_fn`` has the signature of ``ops.moe_gptq_gemm_rdna3``; the RDNA2
+    method passes its own JIT extension here. ``zero_outputs=False`` is for
